    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d297">

                <pb facs="0346" n="286" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg286"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Eustis to Mr. Olney</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-10-18"><hi rendition="#italic">October 18,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>At my request, Waller, whose constitution is weak, is being transferred to Mmes,
                    in the south of France. His wife’s letters have been delivered to him.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Eustis</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
